# libs/api-client is generated from the OpenAPI document published by backend/api
# (openapi-generator, typescript-angular). Never hand-edit; regenerate with
# `npm run generate:api-client` instead. See
# openspec/changes/00-bootstrap-monorepo/design.md "Contrato Java -> TypeScript".
# eol=lf: scripts/api-client/generate.mjs copies the generator's raw output
# byte-for-byte (LF); without this, a CRLF-converted checkout on Windows
# makes every generated file look "changed" to --check on line endings
# alone, permanently failing the CI drift-check step (task 6.1) regardless
# of whether the OpenAPI contract actually drifted.
libs/api-client/src/** linguist-generated=true text eol=lf

# Shell scripts must keep LF line endings regardless of the checkout
# platform's core.autocrlf: a CRLF-converted gradlew or entrypoint.sh breaks
# with "not found" / "syntax error" under /bin/sh, which is exactly what the
# repo root Dockerfile's Gradle build stage runs (see openspec/changes/
# 00-bootstrap-monorepo/tasks.md, task 6.4).
backend/gradlew text eol=lf
docker/**/*.sh text eol=lf
Dockerfile text eol=lf
.dockerignore text eol=lf
.github/workflows/*.yml text eol=lf
